  Adapted from SorinFlow (Tecso-Dev/SorinFlow-DaTA-mAmager), MIT License.

  https://github.com/Tecso-Dev/SorinFlow-DaTA-mAmager

  SorinFlow collects PROPERTY listings from Divar. Carried over here: the
  Persian/Arabic numeral and amount-word normalisation, the use of a real
  browser for a client-rendered site, and heavy-tailed request delays.

  Not carried over, by design: contact reveal, multi-account rotation, and
  session/OTP handling. CARO's ingest contract forbids emitting personal
  identifiers and forbids working around a block; porting those components
  would have contradicted invariants this project tests for. See the module
  docstring in caro/ingest/divar_car.py.

  The car domain model — make, model, trim, year, mileage, gearbox, fuel and
  body condition — is original to CARO. No property field transfers.

